OL,0,        ECIMSBWebfax 1   F329A1789624064
OL,1,W5j 5Q5 7575747575x0w1w1 w17571
OL,2,W//%*// //%Q-$-%%%-!-%%%" ,%-$ -$%%-% ,,
OL,3,GNEWSACommunication concerns raised over
OL,4,Amum's death
OL,5,
OL,6,FSenior coroner Penelope Schofield
OL,7,Fraised concerns about communication
OL,8,Fbetween specialists at the Royal Sussex
OL,9,FCounty Hospital in Brighton, where she
OL,10,Fwas being treated, and the Royal Surrey
OL,11,FCounty Hospital, who advised on her
OL,12,Fcare.
OL,14,FA Royal Surrey spokesperson said it
OL,15,Faccepted communication "presented
OL,16,Fchallenges" and committed to improving,
OL,17,Fwhile University Hospitals Sussex said
OL,18,Fnew systems had been introduced.
OL,23,APub: 16-SepQppppppppppppppppppppppG2/2
